@startuml RF2_Componentes
title RF2 — Autenticar usuário na plataforma com credenciais de acesso\nDiagrama de componentes — login, BFF da sessão, filtros da API e portas de autenticação
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #CBC6BE
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FF
  BorderColor #4A4852
}

package "Frontend (Next.js 16)" {
  component "(auth)/login/page.tsx\n+ auth-form.tsx" as FE0
  component "lib/auth/session.tsx\n(AuthProvider · useAuth)\ncomponents/app-shell.tsx (RequireAuth)" as FE2
  component "lib/api/client.ts\n(tokenStore em memória · tryRefresh com\nWeb Lock · BroadcastChannel · renewGate)" as FE1
  component "app/bff/auth/[action]/route.ts\n(cookie HttpOnly fai_rt · IP assinado · X-Dev-Gate)" as BFF
  component "middleware.ts\n(dev gate + CSP com nonce)" as MW
}
package "fai-web" {
  [DevGateFilter (-103)] as DGF
  [AuthRateLimitFilter (-102)\nlimite por IP + teto de hashes] as RLF
  [ClientIpResolver] as CIR
  [SecurityConfig\n(oauth2ResourceServer JWT, STATELESS)] as Sec
  [JwtConfig\n(JwtDecoder: iss + aud)] as JCfg
  [SessionActiveFilter\n(sid ainda ativo?)] as SF
  [AuthController\n/api/auth/login · refresh · logout] as AC
  [CurrentUserResolver] as CUR
  [AuditAuthenticationEntryPoint\nAuditAccessDeniedHandler] as AEP
  [JwtTokenIssuer] as Jwt
  [Argon2PasswordHasher] as Hasher
}
package "fai-application" {
  [IdentityService] as IS
  [NotificationService] as NS
  [Audit → AuditService] as AUD
  [TokenIssuerPort] <<port>> as P_TOK
  [PasswordHasherPort] <<port>> as P_HASH
  [RateLimitPort] <<port>> as P_RATE
  [EmailSenderPort] <<port>> as P_MAIL
}
package "fai-domain · repositórios" {
  [UserRepository · RefreshTokenRepository\nVerificationCodeRepository · UserPreferencesRepository] as REPOS
}
package "fai-infrastructure" {
  [InMemoryRateLimit / RedisAdapters] as Rate
  [ResendEmailSender / LoggingEmailSender] as Resend
  [MysqlAuditService] as MAudit
}
database "MySQL · fashionai_app\n• users · refresh_tokens\n• verification_codes\n• notifications · audit_log" as DB
cloud "Redis (opcional)\nchaves rate:*" as C_redis
cloud "Resend\n(código 2FA)" as C_mail

FE0 --> FE2 : signIn
FE2 --> FE1 : restoreSession · signOut
FE1 --> BFF : login · refresh · logout (mesma origem)
FE1 --> DGF : /api/** (Bearer + X-Dev-Gate)
MW ..> BFF : sem gate → 403 DEV_GATE
BFF --> DGF : HTTPS/JSON\nX-Fai-Client-Ip/Ts/Sig
DGF --> RLF
RLF --> CIR
RLF --> P_RATE
RLF --> Sec
Sec --> JCfg
Sec --> SF : depois do BearerTokenAuthenticationFilter
Sec ..> AEP : 401/403 auditados
SF --> IS : sessionActive(sid)
SF --> AC
AC --> IS
AC ..> CUR
IS --> P_TOK
IS --> P_HASH
IS --> P_RATE
IS --> P_MAIL
IS --> NS : NEW_LOGIN_DEVICE
IS --> AUD
IS --> REPOS
NS --> REPOS
P_TOK <|.. Jwt
P_HASH <|.. Hasher
P_RATE <|.. Rate
P_MAIL <|.. Resend
AUD --> MAudit
REPOS --> DB : JPA / Flyway
MAudit --> DB
Rate --> C_redis : INCR / TTL
Resend --> C_mail
@enduml
